Revision history for WoLFPSort

0.200 2026-11-25
    - Refactor WoLF PSORT into modular lib/WoLFPSort/ distribution with Makefile.PL
    - Replace 32-bit wolfPredict ELF binary with portable WoLFPSort::KNN and
      WoLFPSort::UniformScaler (optional PDL acceleration with pure-Perl fallback)
    - Extract ModelLoader, FeatureExtractor, FastaCleaner, Motif modules, and
      in-process CLI drivers (WoLFPSort::CLI::Predict, WoLFPSort::CLI::Summary)
    - Add unit, end-to-end parity, pure-Perl fallback, and author (xt/) test suites
